OL,3,GNEWSAConcern grows over catapult
OL,4,Aattacks after bird deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have grown about catapults
OL,7,Fbeing used to attack wildlife in West
OL,8,FSussex after 25 birds were found dead
OL,9,Fat a railway station.
OL,11,FWest Sussex Wildlife Protection (WSWP)
OL,12,Frescuers said they believed the doves
OL,13,Fand pigeons were dumped at Chichester
OL,14,FRailway Station on 3 September after
OL,15,Fbeing killed with a catapult the night
OL,16,Fbefore.
OL,18,FResidents in nearby Selsey have been
OL,19,Fpatrolling East Beach Pond, after what
OL,20,Fthey said had been 15 attacks in the
OL,21,Fseaside town this year alone.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
