OL,3,GNEWSAConcern grows over catapult
OL,4,Aattacks after bird deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said it
OL,7,Fwas investigating the Chichester
OL,8,Fattack, while Sussex Police said such
OL,9,Freports were "relatively rare" but
OL,10,Fthere had been patrols, including by
OL,11,Fplain clothes officers, in the area.
